<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank says no discount rate cut.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank says no discount rate cut.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Wednesday denied a market report that it has cut its 10.50 percent bank or discount rate.</p>
<p>Central bank officials said the bank has not decided on any reduction of the rate which it charges on loans to commercial banks.</p>
<p>The officials said the current rate has not changed since March 1995.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
